    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you take the Attack action, you can spend 1 maelstrom point to wreathe your attacks in the element of your Elemental Attunement until the end of your turn. Each attack deals an additional 1d4 damage of your elemental attunement's type on a hit. You choose which of your Elemental Attunements' damage type to lash out with when you activate this strike.</p><p>You can use Elemental Strike in combination with another strike when you make an attack.</p>",
